items ({({"Large futon chair","This is a large comfortable futon, which is lavishly covered in black velvet.","Large over-stuffed chair","This chair is located on the opposite wall from the futon (west).  It is black.","coffee table","This is a large sturdy oak table with fancy Celtic carving.","couch","This is a large, black leather, over-stuffed couch, flanked by two end tables.","end table","This table is a matching piece to the coffee table, and is at the right end of couch.","end table 2","This is the same as other, it sits at left end of couch.","thick shag rug","This beautifully luxurious rug cover the entire floor.  It is a beautiful pale blue.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
